<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z SIGNS PLN 5.2 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z SIGNS PLN 5.2 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Mostostal Zabrze SA signed a 5.2-million-zloty contract to build a radio and television broadcasting mast in Koszalin, northern Poland, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the work would be completed by November 30, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
